      "source": ["# データを読む\n", "`data/scores.csv` に受験者ごとの点数が入っています。次のセルで読み込んでください。"]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": ["import csv\n", "\n", "with open(\"data/scores.csv\") as file:\n", "    rows = list(csv.DictReader(file))\n", "rows"]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": ["平均点を求めます。"]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": ["scores = [int(row[\"score\"]) for row in rows]\n", "sum(scores) / len(scores)"]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": ["結果を確認したら、Notebookを保存してください。"]
    }
  ],
